# Functional Requirements

## 1. Introduction

This document defines the functional requirements for the E-commerce Sales Performance & Customer Behaviour Analysis project.

## 2. Functional Requirements

| ID | Requirement | Description | Priority |
|---|---|---|---|
| FR01 | Revenue Monitoring | The dashboard must display total revenue. | High |
| FR02 | Monthly Sales | The dashboard must show monthly sales trends. | High |
| FR03 | Product Analysis | The dashboard must identify top-selling products. | High |
| FR04 | Country Analysis | The dashboard must display revenue by country. | Medium |
| FR05 | Customer Analysis | The dashboard must show customer purchasing behaviour. | High |
| FR06 | Sales Comparison | Users must be able to compare sales across different periods. | Medium |

## 3. Non-Functional Requirements

| ID | Requirement | Description |
|---|---|---|
| NFR01 | Usability | The dashboard should be easy to navigate. |
| NFR02 | Performance | The dashboard should load efficiently. |
| NFR03 | Accuracy | Calculations should accurately reflect the source data. |
| NFR04 | Security | Business data should only be accessible to authorised users. |

## 4. Conclusion

These requirements will guide the development of the sales analysis dashboard and ensure that the solution addresses the business needs of ABC Online Retail Ltd.
